    "text": "Holy sh*t this is F*cking dangerous \n\nRUNNING FABLE 5, KIMI K3, AND GROK 4.5 INSIDE CODEX IS NOW ONE NPM INSTALL AWAY.\n\nThe tool is opencodex, a lightweight local proxy that translates Codex's own API format into whatever provider you actually want underneath it.\n\nSame Codex workflow. Different brain, picked per session.\n\nSetup is genuinely simple.\n\nnpm install -g @bitkyc08/opencodex\nocx init to add a provider\nocx start to run the proxy\n\nFrom there, Codex routes through it automatically, streaming, tool calls, images, all working in both directions.\n\nIt also works with Claude Code directly, auto-context up to 1M tokens, sub-agents included.\n\nBookmark this before you lose the setup steps.",
